{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["Dante Alighieri (1265-1321) probably began this work in 1306. Its first canto begins with: Midway upon the journey of our life I found myself within a forest dark, for the straightforward pathway had been lost.","The Divine Comedy"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"literature\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
