{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["Fifteen men on the dead mans chest— Yo-ho-ho, and a bottle of rum! is a famous line from Treasure Island, a novel by this author published in 1883.","Robert Louis Stevenson"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"literature\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
